===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|anus||anus|lang=la}} + {{term|lingere||to lick|lang=la}}. Coined by sexologist Richard von Krafft-Ebing in the book ''Psychopathia sexualis'' (1886).

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# A form of [[oral sex]] in which the [[tongue]] and [[lip]]s are used for stimulation of a sexual partner's [[anus]].

